  "description": "Nuha Bon Bon is a playful and creamy gourmand fragrance that blends juicy fruits with milky sweetness and soft vanilla warmth. The scent feels youthful, cozy, and dessert-inspired while maintaining a smooth feminine elegance throughout the wear. The opening introduces strawberry, milk, and peach, creating a creamy fruity sweetness that feels soft, juicy, and instantly addictive. The heart develops into orange blossom and ice cream accords, adding airy floral sweetness blended with a rich creamy dessert-like character. The base settles into vanilla absolute, leaving a warm, smooth, and comforting trail that feels cozy, sweet, and long-lasting. Nuha Bon Bon is perfect for women who enjoy creamy fruity gourmand fragrances with soft vanilla warmth and a playful sugary vibe.",
